#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nicla-vision.rst:65
msgid ""
"Thirteen user pins are exposed on the Arduino edge headers (``J1`` and "
"``J2``). Additional debug, recovery, and PMIC signals are routed to test "
"pads on the back of the board."
